@startuml
title DRAFT: accepted-view sizing before first draw; native vector symbols
participant "Session" as Session
participant "main" as Main
participant "facts / selection" as Facts
participant "private drawing controller" as Port
participant "SVG leaf" as Leaf
participant "native layout / fonts" as Metrics
Session -> Main : accepted ChartDTO + acceptance cause
Main -> Main : set current session state
Main -> Facts : update accepted view
Facts -> Main : onAspectModeChange (including false)
Main -> Main : data-page-mode from accepted chart_ready, before snapshot
note over Main, Facts
Form mode is centered. Accepted chart mode uses full container width.
Editor collapse still consumes accepted cause once; no new policy.
end note
Facts -> Facts : retained tables, concise south_node label; palette legend
Facts -> Metrics : measure native image frame, CSS width + viewport height
Metrics --> Facts : CSS pixel width (no viewBox/font shrink)
Facts -> Port : immutable snapshot with actual final frame width
Port -> Leaf : update(snapshot, publish, connected revision surface)
Leaf -> Metrics : text getBBox; R3 vectors getBBox for chiron/pars_fortune/selena
Metrics --> Leaf : actual shape/text bounds
Leaf -> Leaf : source house rows, source aspect/true anchors, no fact recalculation
Leaf -> Port : passive SVG (closed data-symbol metadata)
Port -> Port : validate / clone / recheck / install
alt height-only resize changes CSS width
 Metrics -> Facts : ResizeObserver; retained selection
 Facts -> Port : new width revision; no HTTP
end
note over Facts, Leaf
Colors share ASPECT_COLORS; HTML text explains category/type.
R3 symbol definitions are immutable; vector geometry is font independent.
Local failure preserves full accepted HTML. Session/API/engine unchanged.
end note
@enduml
